  <refbody>
    <section id="release" outputclass="release-heading">
      <title>Release Note 26.6.1.0 (June 2026)</title>
    </section>

    <section id="systems-updated">
      <title>Systems Updated</title>
      <p>The following content systems were refreshed in this release. Effective dates reflect
        the latest available content synchronization.</p>
      <table frame="all" id="systems-table">
        <title>Systems and effective dates</title>
        <tgroup cols="3">
          <colspec colname="c1" colwidth="1*"/>
          <colspec colname="c2" colwidth="2*"/>
          <colspec colname="c3" colwidth="1*"/>
          <thead>
            <row>
              <entry>System Code</entry>
              <entry>System Name / Region</entry>
              <entry>Effective Date</entry>
            </row>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <row>
              <entry>HTS A</entry>
              <entry>United States</entry>
              <entry>01 Jul 2026</entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>CN8</entry>
              <entry>European Union</entry>
              <entry>01 Jul 2026</entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>HS UK</entry>
              <entry>United Kingdom</entry>
              <entry>15 Jun 2026</entry>
            </row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section id="de-minimis">
      <title>Changes to De Minimis Rules</title>
      <dl outputclass="change-card">
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Jurisdiction</dt>
          <dd>United States</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Update</dt>
          <dd>Section 321 de minimis exemption for low-value shipments removed for all countries
            of origin.</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Effective From</dt>
          <dd>01 Jul 2026</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Impact</dt>
          <dd>Shipments previously exempt under the $800 de minimis threshold are now subject to
            duty and formal/informal entry requirements regardless of origin.</dd>
        </dlentry>
      </dl>
      <p>No other de minimis rule changes in this release.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="hs-taxonomy">
      <title>Changes to HS Taxonomy</title>
      <p outputclass="system-heading"><b>CN8 (European Union)</b></p>
      <dl outputclass="change-card">
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Additions</dt>
          <dd>07 (Edible vegetables); 08 (Edible fruit and nuts)</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Deletions</dt>
          <dd>none</dd>
        </dlentry>
      </dl>
      <p outputclass="system-heading"><b>HS UK (United Kingdom)</b></p>
      <dl outputclass="change-card">
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Additions</dt>
          <dd>none</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Deletions</dt>
          <dd>97 (Works of art, collectors' pieces and antiques) — chapter retired from the UK
            tariff schedule</dd>
        </dlentry>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section id="customs-valuation">
      <title>Changes to Customs Valuation Approaches</title>
      <p>No changes.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="updated-content">
      <title>Updated Cross-Border Content</title>
      <p outputclass="system-heading"><b>HTS A (United States)</b></p>
      <dl outputclass="change-card">
        <dlentry>
          <dt>MFN changes</dt>
          <dd>Chapter 84 (Machinery and mechanical appliances) — updated general duty rates.</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Preferential changes</dt>
          <dd>USMCA preferential rates updated for Chapters 61–62 (apparel) covering Mexico and
            Canada.</dd>
        </dlentry>
      </dl>
      <p outputclass="system-heading"><b>CN8 (European Union)</b></p>
      <dl outputclass="change-card">
        <dlentry>
          <dt>MFN changes</dt>
          <dd>none</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Preferential changes</dt>
          <dd>EU–Vietnam FTA preferential coverage expanded to Chapter 85 (electrical machinery).
            Full list of affected tariff lines has been condensed; see linked coverage reference
            for details.</dd>
        </dlentry>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section id="new-content">
      <title>New Cross-Border Content Added</title>
      <p>No changes.</p>
    </section>

